                  "content": "As checked October 19, 2026, DEQ lists the air quality construction permit application as under review. Its BACT, dispersion-modeling and draft air-permit public meetings are still listed as TBD. The October request for more information is not a permit approval or denial. Use official notices for comment deadlines and submission instructions.",
