              "name": "Eyebrow",
              "fill": "$alert",
              "content": "WHAT THE MAP IS BUILT ON",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": 2.5
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "PIwLa",
              "name": "Body",
              "fill": "$muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "The supplied Protect Inola graphic cites the September 3, 2026 PSD application, Tables 2.1-1, B-1 and B-2. These numbers are transcribed from the graphic, not independently verified against the tables here. DEQ lists the corrected September 3 application as under technical review. Colored bands are fixed annual illustrations, not the current plume or exposure zones. The school counter tallies synthetic wind directions within 25° of the approximate school bearing; it does not calculate plume arrival, concentrations, or actual school exposure.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
