                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "vIw8N",
                      "name": "Tier",
                      "fill": "#B02010",
                      "content": "TIER I · LOCAL",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "700",
                      "letterSpacing": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "l7tDQG",
                      "name": "Name",
                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "content": "Fluoride",
                      "lineHeight": 0.92,
                      "fontFamily": "Anton",
                      "fontSize": 48,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "gyUSe",
                      "name": "Distance",
                      "fill": "$muted",
                      "content": "1.8–8 KM · ILLUSTRATIVE BAND",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "700",
                      "letterSpacing": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "iuEE0",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The September proposal lowers the potline fluoride cap to 0.64 lb per metric ton of aluminum, according to KJRH, 37% below the original proposal. This is not a whole-facility annual total or evidence of approval. Deposition and exposure depend on emissions, weather and other site-specific factors; the illustrated bands are not a regulatory dispersion study.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 15,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "g3cil",
                  "name": "SO₂ & NOx",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "stroke": "#E07A28",
                  "strokeWidth": {
                    "top": 4
                  },
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 12,
                  "padding": [
                    24,
                    0,
                    0,
                    0
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "PyEU4",
                      "name": "Tier",
                      "fill": "#E07A28",
                      "content": "TIER II · REGIONAL",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "700",
                      "letterSpacing": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "bzkGZ",
                      "name": "Name",
                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "content": "SO₂ & NOx",
                      "lineHeight": 0.92,
                      "fontFamily": "Anton",
                      "fontSize": 48,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "VfTVd",
                      "name": "Distance",
                      "fill": "$muted",
                      "content": "15–60 KM · ILLUSTRATIVE BAND",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "700",
                      "letterSpacing": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "pJdZS",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Sulfur and nitrogen oxides oxidise over hours to days into sulfate and nitrate aerosols — acid deposition and fine particulate haze. Site-specific modeling is needed to evaluate possible effects on Class I wilderness areas. The bands on this map do not establish that emissions reach them.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 15,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "rNhyA",
                  "name": "PFCs",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "stroke": "#7A63B4",
                  "strokeWidth": {
                    "top": 4
                  },
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 12,
                  "padding": [
                    24,
                    0,
                    0,
                    0
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "e6vm8",
                      "name": "Tier",
                      "fill": "#7A63B4",
                      "content": "TIER III · GLOBAL",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "700",
                      "letterSpacing": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "zng7v",
                      "name": "Name",
                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "content": "PFCs",
                      "lineHeight": 0.92,
                      "fontFamily": "Anton",
                      "fontSize": 48,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "v0WoxM",
                      "name": "Distance",
                      "fill": "$muted",
                      "content": "NO LIMIT · ILLUSTRATIVE BAND",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "700",
                      "letterSpacing": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "o6hiqz",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Released during anode effects in the smelting process. Chemically inert in the lower atmosphere, with lifetimes measured at 10,000 to 50,000 years. There is no distance at which these stop. They will outlast every institution now arguing about the permit.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 15,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
